{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Blur009.BlurAutoClicker","latestVersion":"3.10.2","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.d51a5035.png","priority":1,"sha256":"d51a50355f15bd944879811d04d95146032ed1beb87a1cc01812f0213756a211","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Blur009","copyright":"Copyright (c) Blur009","description":"An Auto-clicker with a few advanced features and generally better performance than popular alternatives.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Blur009/Blur-AutoClicker/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Blur009","copyright":"Copyright (c) Blur009","description":"An Auto-clicker with a few advanced features and generally better performance than popular alternatives.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Blur009/Blur-AutoClicker/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","moniker":"blurautoclicker","name":"Blur-AutoClicker","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Blur009/Blur-AutoClicker","publisher":"Blur009","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Blur009/Blur-AutoClicker/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Blur009","releaseNotes":"## New\n\n- Added settings search bar.\n- Added per-click sound setting, with a waveform preview you can trim with drag handles.\n- Added startup error codes.\n\n## Changed\n\n- Changed changelog date display to hover card.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Hopefully fixed UI not being interactable since 3.10.0 on some machines.\n- Fixed the fatal error on Windows shutdown.\n- Fixed the window freezing while the app restarts as administrator.\n- Fixed startup dialogs always suggesting a WebView2 reinstall even when it was not the problem.\n- Fixed a flash of an unelevated window at launch when \"start as administrator\" is on.\n- Fixed turning \"start as administrator\" off not restarting the app.\n- Fixed a WebView2 hang while creating the window.\n- Fixed the window never appearing when the first sizing step failed.\n- Fixed a